 "about_text": "Stroll Garden is a Los Angeles gallery representing a roster of emerging and mid-career artists working primarily in ceramics and sculptural design, many with ties to Korean or Korean American heritage. The program spans hand-built stoneware, thrown vessels, and functional design objects, often presented in gallery exhibitions and at design fairs such as Design Miami. The gallery operates two Los Angeles spaces, one in the Hollywood Hills and one on Beverly Boulevard, and has built a reputation for showing artists whose work bridges fine art and design.",
